{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "bulk-csv-import-collection",
		"name": "BedSched - Bulk CSV Import",
		"description": "Postman collection for bulk CSV import endpoint",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Bulk Import CSV to Block",
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Authorization",
						"value": "Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE",
						"type": "text",
						"description": "Replace with your actual JWT token"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "formdata",
					"formdata": [
						{
							"key": "csv",
							"type": "file",
							"src": [],
							"description": "Upload your CSV file here (Name, Gender, Phone, Emergency Phone, Start date, End date)"
						}
					]
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "http://localhost:3001/api/locations/:locationId/tents/:tentIndex/blocks/:blockIndex/bulk-import-csv",
					"protocol": "http",
					"host": [
						"localhost"
					],
					"port": "3001",
					"path": [
						"api",
						"locations",
						":locationId",
						"tents",
						":tentIndex",
						"blocks",
						":blockIndex",
						"bulk-import-csv"
					],
					"variable": [
						{
							"key": "locationId",
							"value": "55",
							"description": "Location ID (e.g., 55)"
						},
						{
							"key": "tentIndex",
							"value": "1",
							"description": "Tent index (e.g., 1)"
						},
						{
							"key": "blockIndex",
							"value": "1",
							"description": "Block index (e.g., 1)"
						}
					]
				},
				"description": "Bulk import allocations from CSV file to a specific block.\n\n**CSV Format Required:**\n```\nName,Gender,Phone,Emergency Phone,Start date,End date\nJohn Doe,Male,9876543210,9876543211,2025-11-12,2025-11-20\nJane Smith,Female,9876543212,,2025-11-15,2025-11-25\n```\n\n**Features:**\n- Auto-assigns beds sequentially\n- Validates gender restrictions\n- Checks bed availability upfront\n- Bulk inserts for performance\n- Full audit logging\n\n**Response Example:**\n```json\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Import completed: 45 successful, 2 failed\",\n  \"results\": {\n    \"total\": 47,\n    \"success\": 45,\n    \"failed\": 2,\n    \"errors\": [\n      {\n        \"row\": 15,\n        \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n        \"error\": \"No available beds in block\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```"
			},
			"response": [
				{
					"name": "Success - All Imported",
					"originalRequest": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{
									"key": "csv",
									"type": "file",
									"src": "sample.csv"
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "http://localhost:3001/api/locations/55/tents/1/blocks/1/bulk-import-csv",
							"protocol": "http",
							"host": [
								"localhost"
							],
							"port": "3001",
							"path": [
								"api",
								"locations",
								"55",
								"tents",
								"1",
								"blocks",
								"1",
								"bulk-import-csv"
							]
						}
					},
					"status": "OK",
					"code": 200,
					"_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
					"header": [
						{
							"key": "Content-Type",
							"value": "application/json"
						}
					],
					"cookie": [],
					"body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Import completed: 50 successful, 0 failed\",\n  \"results\": {\n    \"total\": 50,\n    \"success\": 50,\n    \"failed\": 0,\n    \"errors\": []\n  }\n}"
